{"id":"wb-5-341","name":"天宁寺三圣塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天宁寺三圣塔","text":"天宁寺三圣塔位于中国河南省沁阳市城内东南部沁阳博物馆院内，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n天宁寺始建于隋，初名长寿寺，唐改称大云寺，金改称天宁寺并建塔。寺院已毁，仅存寺塔。塔为十三级密檐叠涩式砖塔，塔身为优美的抛物线型，高32.76米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E5%AE%81%E5%AF%BA%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%A3%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86313633,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86313633","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bb3fbd0dba66f9191d039f18.jpg","title":"20240824_Sansheng_Pagoda_of_Tianning_Temple_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240824_Sansheng_Pagoda_of_Tianning_Temple_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/20240824_Sansheng_Pagoda_of_Tianning_Temple_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​天宁寺三圣塔","width":320,"height":213}}